page('templates.html','LaTeX template & page design',intro('Author resources · Template v1.0','Research, beautifully typeset.','A distinctive article format for electrical, computer and digital engineering. Editable LaTeX source, an illustrated sample and a practical manuscript starter.')+'''<section><div class="two"><div><div class="eyebrow">The JECDE article system</div><h2>Precision on every page.</h2><p>A full-width opening page, a clear abstract panel and a balanced two-column body. Forest-green accents connect equations, captions and algorithms without distracting from the research.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="downloads/JECDE_LaTeX_Template.zip" download>Download LaTeX package ↓</a><a class="button secondary" href="downloads/JECDE_Article_Sample.pdf">View sample PDF ↗</a></div><p class="muted">Version 1.0 · A4 · pdfLaTeX · Editable source · Overleaf-compatible</p><a href="https://github.com/YassirALKarawi/YassirALKarawi.github.io/tree/main/jecde">View journal source on GitHub →</a></div><a href="downloads/JECDE_Article_Sample.pdf" aria-label="Open the illustrated PDF sample"><img src="downloads/article-preview.webp" alt="JECDE article opening page with journal identity, title, abstract and two-column text" style="width:100%;height:auto;max-width:480px;display:block;margin:auto;box-shadow:0 14px 35px #122c3620;border:1px solid #dde4df" width="778" height="1100"></a></div></section><section><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>Opening page</h3><p>Journal masthead, article type, title, authors, affiliations, correspondence, abstract and keywords.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Scholarly details</h3><p>Numbered equations, formal tables, vector figures, running headers and a dedicated algorithm header-bar environment.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Practical files</h3><p>Journal class, clean manuscript starter, illustrated example, compiled PDF, build instructions and a template-code licence.</p></div></div></section><section><h2>Start writing in three steps.</h2><ol><li>Download and extract the ZIP package, or upload its contents to a new Overleaf project.</li><li>Select <code>main.tex</code> as the main document and use pdfLaTeX. Keep <code>jecde.cls</code> in the same folder.</li><li>Replace the instructional fields, write the manuscript and compile twice to resolve cross-references.</li></ol><details><summary>Anonymous review option</summary><p>Use <code>\\documentclass[review]{jecde}</code> to hide the title-block author metadata. This does not anonymize acknowledgments, content or attached files. Inspect the manuscript manually. The journal's final review policy remains pending.</p></details><div class="notice">The sample illustrates page design and is not a published article. No DOI, ISSN, acceptance date or indexing status is assigned by the template.</div></section>''')
